<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="toc1">2TI</para>
  <para style="toc2">2TI</para>
  <para style="toc3">2TI</para>
  <para style="mt">2TI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Ubungagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Gya, Bulus, bucuma bu Kristi Yesu na nupi Hwinsu zwama a cubage alkawari ahuru ana ayiwa na suwa Kristi Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />kuruwa pa Timoti, bwa bumui bu maka̠la̠:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">I burya̱, yama, na dala a burya̠ kore pa Hwinsu Buca̱ na Kristi Yesu u yan na goo<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igojo na karfafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Na gojo Hwinsu, buna bu gya na lagan nga̱ hacaca ahamui haba ia̱gi, hinda na suwa uinka, inga na gita na hwinsu si mabutaragi na ga̱hi pa ahunda̱. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Hun na gya na mabutaryaga maisa amahi, si cimgagu na hyan zwama gya masinji na wa̱wo. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Na mabutaryaga na tani i suwa i kamahinda ina tun na jigu iyiwa na simaci asihin Iloyes hinda amaci nabwe Afiniki, ina gya na daki ibiya goo buza. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Zwama harbuniya ubi sa gya nayiwa na mabutaryaga amagana daje una uyiwa na suwa nubwe, una u Hwinsu uba pa huna gya nabu jukani wa nabu tani unu u burya̠ . <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Zwama anhuru na Hwinsu uba ci pa a ci sanuwa cisa aco iwasa, ama ahuru a kuce, ana a maka̠la̠ na ikumgagu icwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Zwama harbuni ta huga muniya mu sheda Bugwama bu dwoniya, ko guwo hugi muniya amumui ko buna buyiwa ni nokaba u ci'incu ama na banga na sunguro zwamo cikarigo ci Hwinsu, na kuce Hwinsu, <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />buna bu ci ce hinda bwa ci uga na nagu ciri-sa zwama ci za ihya ko ina gacu ia̠gi ama zwama uba ka̱ri pa i burya̠ waba. Ana alheri a ci pa se zwama Yesu Kristi kamin irwagu u doone, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Ama baniya aci cibe kuro u bu cyagagu Kristi Yesu. bware bube bu subkai u'o hinda kwa ni ci kulage cingero a̱huru dala ana aza ihogu pa cikarigo ci laco i Hwinsu. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Zwama cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci laco, aba na tani sa bu labe bu cikarigo ci Hwinsu na walami, buna bu sa almajiri na bu cibago bu cikarigo ci laco. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Zwama harbuniya ube usa gya na sungula inga gya ni yiwa na sungula baniya. Zwama na daki buna bu gya na yaji na buba, hinda na suwa numui na yaji wai pwan na tale na ina uba ni pa hal kuruwa hwinsu ni. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Kumgaga icibago i kamahinda na kuce, ina guwo bu hugi pa ahwamui i koyi na ciba na itanu i suwa na maka̠la̠ na suwa u Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Ea kula na icibagu ina i kamahinda ina abu pan amana, pa taimako ahuru a Hwinsu ana a yiwa na suwa nuhin. <verse eid="2TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Bu daki tigamba na Asiya buni pa kacutu gya Bulus, kamu na Faijelus na Hamojenis. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Hwinsu u cibe yama na yaba i Onesiforus, zwama tunuhun bware si ni paga numa, bware bwa huguwo muniya zwama ni yiwa na yaba ci'incu. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Ama maimako haruni inga Onesiforus uba bu wuci Roma, bware buna gimbagi gya Bulus hal bu ni hyan. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Hwinsu u sa Onesiforus bu hin yama pa Hwinsu na hunna! Guwo ma bu daki kanmu iri i burya̠ ina bware buba na egyi na Apisa.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Guwo bwa bumui, yisan na koce na i burya̠ a Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Hinda icibago ina guwo bu hugi ahwamui zwamaga cya pa aco kamu alagano ana ciye cikarigo goo ma cutaga ana za aminci. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Ea hankuri na ga̠ci inga usoja u burya̠ u Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Aza u soja una yiwa na ibwana una wui tana icwa yoba na ibwana ina ya sa ya soja zwama nufi u soja usa u labe woba u hugi laco. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Na lago munda nabiya, aza buna bwe hyan daje u nasara kwa bu laga dokoki u lago uniya. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Ai buco bu cuma buna bu iyi cuma dinyiya bubiya bu kamaci ina buba kabi ni jigu. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Ea tunani ina gya nabu zwama, zwama Hwinsu ui bu pana idaku tibai kanmu. <verse eid="2TI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Mabutaryaga na Yesu Kristi, ana Hwinsu uba yasingai pa aco na a kwadagu, ana asa biro Dauda. Cibi cisa cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci laco, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />zwama cibiya gya na yiwa na su wahala hal ani palage na marimari inga buco bu magwata. Ama cikarigo ci Hwinsu a palaguwo na marimari. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Zwama harbuniya na i hakuri na tibai kanmu zwama aco na aba zabi zwama aba ma a hin izangacu ina iza ihogu iyiwa na Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Cikarigo cini cisa ci kamahinda: Sa ci kwaji na Yesu, hinda ci madala na bware; <verse eid="2TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />sa ci i hankuri, ci ea cigwama na bware. Sa yajuwa na bware, bware hinda buza yaji na gaci; <verse eid="2TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />sa ci za itani isuwa na bware, bware bwe yisan na itana isuwa, zwama bware buza i wonje icwa ibuba.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buco bu i bwana i Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Hinan na buturyagiga cikarigo cini. Butana ga na gaba Hwinsu ata iga masasa zwama cikarigo; zwama uza ampani, kwadi ci hacigaga suwa aco na yiwa na hugagu cya. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Ea kokari nubwe yisa pan icwa nibui pa Hwinsu una uba yaji, buco bu ibwana buna buza mun'iya hinda sa kumgagi cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci kamahinda. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Curya cikarigo ci kawui ci nagu i wasa i Hwinsu, zwama si sa aco i dala nagu a hali a iri Hwinsu cikarigo cyaba. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Icibagu yaba si kure tuhunba inga aguba ana ayiwa na zata ana ayiwa na re munigwa na ikanga. na ciki waba Himeniyus ayiwa na Filetus, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Acyagiya acuri cikarigo ci kamahinda. Aba hyen ana aco na a kwadago a masiga, aba na inacuma iyajo i cagiya aco. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Kanmu na haruni utare una u madaliye una Hwinsu uba iri uyiwa daram na lamba una aba rubuci na sinu waba, &lt;&lt;Hwinsu u daki aco na usa waba,&gt;&gt; hinda, &lt;&lt;Kanmu buna bu yaje na iziya i Bugwama bu dwoniya Yesu dole bu curi eewo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2TI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Na suwa yaba labe sa na zinariya na sizurpa sibe si yiwa na yaba kawui, cinubo ci ima sitako ayiwa na suwa yaba uni zwama ibwana; ini kanmu izi ibwana iyaba aza ina i ea ibwana i burya̠ aza ina i ea ibwana eewo. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Kanmu buna za magwata ma eewo bwe sana buco buna aba Hwinsu uba ui ea ibwana na buba i kimgana ba bu egyi ka̠mu ibwana i burya̠ . <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Suma pa maka̠la̠ ma eewo alagasa, tana icwa nibu pa gibo u nagu ciri, itana isuwa, maka̠la̠ na dala a burya̠ , kanmu na uni buna bwa uga ize Bugwama bu dwoniya na suwa u burya̠ . <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Ta ea masasa ma kawui ma nagu icwa, zwama bu daki masasa si kuliya cihurya. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Bugyama bu Bugwama bu dwoniya Yesu bwe eago ibwana; na haruni, busa buco bu yama pa tagamba, bu pwa icibago, busa buco bu hankuri. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Ana a wanje bo bu egyiga cikarigo na hankali na itana i suwa Hwinsu wui sana ga a curi eewo cibagiga yina u kamahinda, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />zwama i kurya na hankali waba aba ai sire pa yina a buco bu eewo, buna bu zangiga a egyi eewo i buba.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Dala a ihogu i dwoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Bu daki ina na ihogu i dwoniya aco ai su wahala dinyiya. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Aco ai sana maka̠la̠ ma sicwa saba, i sana aco maka̠la̠ ma musarya, aco cikibi, aco izangacu icwa, aco ci cuma, aza lagana cikarigo ci amaci, aza gojiya, na dala a ciri, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />aza maka̠la̠ , kumgagu isuwa, ihacigagu ize i cyagiya aco, nagu i kumgagu icwa yaba, ihunagu i aco, a kanruwo i burya̠ , <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />aco irego amana, aza sicwa, izangacu i icwa i sana aco na i ka̱ri i laco na Hwinsu, <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />pa aco si cibe ana si zi iwasa Hwinsu, ama na dala aba a wanje iko a waba ama pa iri aco ni. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Na suwa waba aza ana si gimbagi yina a isage i yaba ya aco zwama a rudi si'a sina si za mahasa ana magwata ma ise suwa waba hinda na tiwamba maka̠la̠ ma eewo bini na ea cigwama naba <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />iri si'a sini sibi si yiwa na koyo kanmu na haruni a wuciwo inga aba ai daki cikarigo ci kamahinda. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Inga Yannes na Yambres inga aba wanje Musa, harbuni acubago u cibe ni a wanje cikarigo ci kamahinda ci Hwinsu suwa waba hinda usa eewo bane iyajo yaba hinda isa i kawui. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ama acubago a cibe aza imirya zwama i daki ga na ma'inta na nagu u i burya̠ waba u yiwa na ijapu inga aba i na Yannes na Yambres.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umurni u ihogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Goo Timothy, bu daki kanmu icibagu nimui, na hali numui na nupi namui a dala namui, na itano i suwa numui na hankuri numui, na maka̠la̠ amamui na hankuri namui, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Bu daki hinda na masi, na wahala una uni hyin pa Antakiya, na Yakoniya, na Listira, na wahala una gya na i hankuri. ka̱mu na haruni Hwinsu uni caga na suwa waba Hwinsu, <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />kamahinda kanmu buna bu ka̱ri bu i dala iri ana a Hwinsu na suwa Yesu Kristi bwe su wahala dinya, <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />ama aco eewo na una si kuliya rudu hali a magwata maba ui muse dinya ayiwa na rudi aco aba ma na icwa yaba ayiwa na rudi ga. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Ama guwo Timoti i re gaba na ina aba cibage hinda guwo yisa na icibagu kamahinda, zwama bu daki aco na bu cibagi, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />mabuturyaga inga guwo bu yanse bwa bu nuya bu riganu bu daki cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci nagu ciri cina ci bu pana cidaka cina ci bu kula ihinwo iceewo pa kuro itani isuwa pa Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Ka̠mu cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina aba rubuci a hula ca pa a̠huru a Hwinsu ci za ampani na icibagu na ibutano na ikimganu i dala na horo na nagu u ciri, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />zwama kanmu buna busa bu Hwinsu busa buna bu sinji bu yan na shiri zwama ibwana i burya̠ .<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Na yiwa na unag zwama Hwinsu na Kristi Yesu, buna bui ia̱ hukunci pa aco na aza a̱huru na aco na a kwadag, bwe kurya na cigwama ciwoba, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />cibaga cikarigo ci Hwinsu; ko buza dama ko buza dama numi hasuwa ha aco butanaga dulocuma ga soo na hankuri na icibago. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Zwama lokaci ayiwa na kuro aco za ipwan i kumgagu icibagu i cikarigo ci kamahinda maimako haruni i byangan i cibago ina aba gimba i tanagagu sicwa siba aco na ai cibaga ga a cibage ga ina hacube aba gimbo hugi. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Aco hinda ai gundgan hacube haba zwama ata hugaga icibago i kamahinda hankali aba ai maringya pa icibago u icyaro. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Ama goo Timoti, ila hankali nabwe, ia̱ hankuri na suwa wahala ea ibwana buco bu icibago cikarigo ci laco go sinji ibwana bugyama bu Hwinsu. <verse eid="2TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Zwama arigana a jigo a̱huru namui nga̱ hadaya ha ci so, lokaci ana gya ni curya a̱huru namui a wuco. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Na iyi ipwala na burya̠ , na i munda hal kuro ihogu, na kumgage hinda itanu i soo amana. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Baniya a rigano a ni iru paro ana aba ai ni pan daje u nasara na adalci, una u Buca̱ bu yaba buna bu ia̱g shari'a u kamahinda bui ni pan Hwinsu uni. Sa pa gya ama ka̱mu aco na a i hankuri na soo u maka̱la̱ a hyin kuro u bware.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">ihogu i cikarigo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Guwo Timoti ea kokari nubwe kurya pa gya na yiwa, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Zwama Demas ani curi zwama maka̱la̱ ma iyi doone bware bu wali Tasalonika. Kirzens a kure Galatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka ubiya u yisa na gya. Gimbaga Markus kurya na bware zwama bware buzi ampani dinya ahwamui pa ibwana. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Ni cuma Tikikus kuro Apisa. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Lokaci ani guwo bwe kure na kulagiya cilapo ci duro cina gya na curi na wa u Karbus na Toruwas, na hatakada, musamman hataka hana hazi rubutu. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alekzanda bu pyapo bu ni cuci dinya Hwinsu ube ui pana bo gwargwado a ibwana ina goo bu ia̠gi. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Goo ma i kula na bware zwama bware bu gaba na cicuma acici. <verse eid="2TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Na jigu inga gya na yisa pa mugwamgwam aza buna bwa ni lagana kanmu ani swami. Hwinsu uta rutaga eewo yaba. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ama Hwinsu u yanse tare na gya uni pa si koce zwamo pa ahwamui cicuma ci wuci seda a kamahinda ka̱mu na aco na asa hayahudawa a hugi. Ui na silacumi na hukunci u'o. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Hwinsu ui ni silacumi pa eewo ti iri wamba hinda wui ni silacumi u ni kule pa cigwama ciwoba ci zata. Ci pa Hwinsu cilabe na izangacu i yinsa har i hogu i doone. Harbuni.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bungagu i hogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Ni bungage Biskila na Akila na yaba i Onesiforu. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erastus a yiwa har kabaniya na Korintus, hinda na curi Turofimus na mahuna ahwaya na Miletus. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Ia̠ kokari nubwe kurya kamin habo u kurya. Yubulus na Fudens, na Lainus, na kalaodiya, na ka̠mu ahun ayiwa na bungaga. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Hwinsu yan na a̠huru nahin. I burya̠ a yan na ga̠hi. Amin<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>